      "html": "<aside class=\"blog-related bg-charcoal pointer-events-auto\" aria-labelledby=\"blog-related-heading\"><section class=\"blog-index-shell\" data-v-1c6297c3><p class=\"blog-eyebrow\">Keep reading</p><h2 id=\"blog-related-heading\" class=\"blog-section-heading\">More useful growth ideas.</h2><div class=\"blog-index-grid\"><a class=\"blog-card\" href=\"/feed/10-things-to-get-right-with-ai-in-2027\"><div class=\"blog-cover blog-cover--strategy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"blog-cover-topic\">Growth strategy</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M50 210H170V100H310V155H510\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"210\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"100\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"155\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"510\" cy=\"155\" r=\"16\"/></svg><span class=\"blog-cover-word\">Connect the dots.</span></div><div class=\"blog-card-copy\"><p class=\"blog-card-title\">A practical growth plan for search, ads and content</p><p class=\"blog-card-summary\">Build a practical plan that connects customer demand, useful content, paid campaigns and a clear way to measure progress.</p><p class=\"blog-card-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 3 min read</p></div></a><a class=\"blog-card\" href=\"/feed/5-signs-you-need-a-digital-product-agency\"><div class=\"blog-cover blog-cover--strategy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"blog-cover-topic\">Growth strategy</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M50 210H170V100H310V155H510\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"210\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"100\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"155\" r=\"16\"/><circle cx=\"510\" cy=\"155\" r=\"16\"/></svg><span class=\"blog-cover-word\">Connect the dots.</span></div><div class=\"blog-card-copy\"><p class=\"blog-card-title\">5 signs your business needs a connected growth strategy</p><p class=\"blog-card-summary\">Recognise the gaps between visibility, campaigns and enquiries that suggest your marketing needs a more connected plan.</p><p class=\"blog-card-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 3 min read</p></div></a><a class=\"blog-card\" href=\"/feed/above-shaping-future-ready-brand-identity-in-london-through-strategy-creativity-and-ai\"><div class=\"blog-cover blog-cover--content\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"blog-cover-topic\">Content strategy</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"125\" y=\"35\" width=\"300\" height=\"245\" rx=\"28\"/><path d=\"M185 100H350M185 145H365M185 190H315M185 235H275\"/></svg><span class=\"blog-cover-word\">Make it useful.</span></div><div class=\"blog-card-copy\"><p class=\"blog-card-title\">Make your business easier to understand across every channel</p><p class=\"blog-card-summary\">Keep your offer, evidence and business information clear wherever customers encounter you, from search pages to paid campaigns.</p><p class=\"blog-card-meta\">Fyntix Editorial · 3 min read</p></div></a></div></section></aside>"
